---
pagination:
  data: localAreas
  size: 1
  alias: area
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/elderly-removals-{{ area.slug }}/"
modified: "2026-11-17"
bodyClass: "page-template page-loaded svc-topic v2"
activeKey: "areas"
headExtra: |
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chayce-nav.css?v={{ build.version }}">
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{% if area.seoTitle %}{{ area.seoTitle }}{% else %}House Removals {{ area.name }}: Elderly Moves | Chayce{% endif %}"
  description: "House and elderly removals in {{ area.name }}, {{ area.county }}: packing, downsizing help and insured removals from £995, with one coordinator."
---
<header class="v2-hero" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl area.heroImage %});{% imageSet area.heroImage %}">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <h1><span class="h1-kicker">House Removals {{ area.name }}<span class="v2-kick-more"> &middot; {{ area.county }}</span></span>Elderly &amp; House Removals in <em>{{ area.name }}</em></h1>
    <p class="v2-lead">Packing, downsizing help and fully insured removals for {{ area.name }}, coordinated from our Northampton office.</p>
    <div class="v2-actions"><a class="v2-btn primary" href="/get-started/">Get Started</a><a class="v2-tel" href="tel:{{ site.telephone }}"><i class="fas fa-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ site.telephoneDisplay }}</a></div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="v2-trust"><div class="v2-wrap">
  <span class="v2-pill"><i class="fas fa-user-shield" aria-hidden="true"></i>DBS-Checked Team</span>
  <span class="v2-pill"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i>Fully Insured</span>
  <span class="v2-pill"><i class="fas fa-user-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>One Coordinator</span>
  <span class="v2-pill"><i class="fas fa-landmark" aria-hidden="true"></i>Since 2021</span>
</div></div>

<section class="v2-sec grey">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-intro">
      <div><span class="v2-eyebrow">{{ area.name }} &middot; {{ area.county }}</span><h2 class="v2-h2">House removals and downsizing help in <em>{{ area.name }}</em></h2></div>
      <div class="sa-answer">
        <p><strong>Chayce Properties arranges downsizing help, careful packing, fully insured removals and settling-in support in {{ area.name }}, {{ area.county }}, designed for older people and open to anyone, with one dedicated coordinator.</strong> We are based in Northampton, and {{ area.name }} lies {{ area.direction }} of our office.</p>
        <p>{{ area.context }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="v2-sec">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head"><span class="v2-eyebrow">Local facts</span><h2 class="v2-h2">Moving home in <em>{{ area.name }}</em></h2><p class="v2-lede">One coordinator looks after the whole move, so you are not juggling several separate companies.</p></div>
    <div class="v2-incl">
      <div>
        <dl class="v2-facts">
          <div><dt>County</dt><dd>{{ area.county }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Council</dt><dd>{{ area.council }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Postcodes</dt><dd>{{ area.postcodes }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>From our office</dt><dd>{{ area.direction | capitalize }}, via {{ area.road }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Hospital</dt><dd>{{ area.hospital }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Getting around</dt><dd>{{ area.rail }}</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <aside class="v2-price" aria-label="Prices">
        {% for r in [["bronze","from","Packing, insured removal, furniture reassembly and light cleaning."],["silver","from","Adds declutter help, a deep clean and unpacking, with a coordinator."],["discovery","one-off","Not sure yet? A one-hour plan, timeline and budget."]] %}{% set pk = site.packages | findByKey(r[0]) %}<div class="pr"><span class="amt"><small>{{ r[1] }}</small>&pound;{{ pk.price | gbp }}</span><span class="nm">{{ pk.name }}</span><p>{{ r[2] }}</p></div>
        {% endfor %}
        <a class="v2-btn primary" href="/packages/">Compare packages</a>
        <p class="fine">Final price confirmed in writing before you book.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="v2-sec grey">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head c"><span class="v2-eyebrow">Planning your move</span><h2 class="v2-h2">What to plan for <em>in {{ area.name }}</em></h2></div>
    <ol class="v2-steps{% if area.planFor.length == 3 %} v2-steps--3{% endif %}">
      {% for item in area.planFor %}<li><span class="n">0{{ loop.index }}</span><p>{{ item }}</p></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <p class="v2-steps-note">A move in {{ area.name }} falls under {{ area.council }}. Find your council&rsquo;s adult social care services on <a href="https://www.gov.uk/find-local-council" rel="noopener">GOV.UK</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% if area.moves %}
<section class="v2-sec">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head c"><span class="v2-eyebrow">Client story &middot; {{ area.name }}</span><h2 class="v2-h2">A real move <em>in {{ area.name }}</em></h2></div>
    <div class="v2-stories"><article class="v2-story"><span class="v2-story-tag">{{ area.moves.package }}</span><h3>{{ area.moves.title }}</h3><p>{{ area.moves.text }}</p><a href="/case-studies/#{{ area.moves.anchor }}">Read the full client story &rarr;</a></article></div>
    <p class="v2-steps-note">Shared with the client&rsquo;s permission, including naming the town. No names are used on this page.</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if area.localHelp %}
<section class="v2-sec grey">
  <div class="v2-wrap v2-local">
    <div>
      <span class="v2-eyebrow">Local help</span>
      <h2 class="v2-h2">Where to find support in <em>{{ area.name }}</em></h2>
      <p class="v2-lede">Independent organisations, listed for information. Chayce has no commercial link with them and does not give care, financial or legal advice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="v2-links">
      {% for item in area.localHelp %}<a href="{{ item.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ item.label }}<span>{{ item.note }}</span></a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{#- Agent-written sections (SuperRank). Text goes in the page's own two-column look; empty entries render nothing. -#}
{% if area.expandedContent or area.qaContentHtml %}
<section class="v2-sec grey">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="action-center-content">
      {% if area.expandedContent %}{{ area.expandedContent | safe }}{% endif %}
      {% if area.qaContentHtml %}{{ area.qaContentHtml | safe }}{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="v2-sec">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head c"><span class="v2-eyebrow">Questions</span><h2 class="v2-h2">House removals <em>in {{ area.name }}</em></h2></div>
    <div class="v2-faq">
      {% if area.localFaqs %}
      {% for f in area.localFaqs %}<details><summary>{{ f.q }}</summary><p>{{ f.a }}{% if f.url %} <a href="{{ f.url }}"{% if f.ext %} rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ f.linkText }}</a>.{% endif %}</p></details>
      {% endfor %}
      <details><summary>How much do removals in {{ area.name }} cost?</summary><p>Packages start at &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }} for packing and removals, with full-service moves from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("silver")).price | gbp }}. A Discovery Consultation costs &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }} and gives you a personalised plan, timeline and budget before you commit to anything.</p></details>
      {% else %}
      <details><summary>{{ area.faqTitle }}</summary><p>{{ area.faqAnswer }}</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer downsizing help for older people in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>Yes. We help older people in {{ area.name }} decide what to keep, sell or pass on, pack with care, arrange the removal and settle in at the new home.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much do removals in {{ area.name }} cost?</summary><p>Packages start at &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }} for packing and removals, with full-service moves from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("silver")).price | gbp }}. A Discovery Consultation costs &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }} and gives you a personalised plan, timeline and budget before you commit to anything.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What does an elderly move manager do in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>An elderly move manager plans and coordinates a later-life move from start to finish. In {{ area.name }}, Chayce provides this with one dedicated coordinator for sorting, packing, the removal and settling in. See <a href="/elderly-move-manager-uk/">what an elderly move manager does</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer house removals in {{ area.name }} for people of any age?</summary><p>Yes. Our service is designed with older people in mind, but anyone who wants a fully managed move is welcome. We provide one coordinator for packing, a fully insured removal and settling in, and you choose how much of the move we take on.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer removals for elderly people in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>Yes. Removals for older people are part of our service in {{ area.name }}. Every removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit, and a dedicated coordinator looks after the whole move.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer residential removals in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>Yes. Chayce arranges residential removals in {{ area.name }} and across the UK: packing, a fully insured removal and settling in, with one dedicated coordinator. Packages start at &pound;995, and you can start with a Discovery Consultation.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Are your staff DBS-checked?</summary><p>Yes. See our <a href="/trust-and-safeguarding/">trust and safeguarding page</a> for how we protect clients.</p></details>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="v2-sec" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head c"><span class="v2-eyebrow">Keep exploring</span><h2 class="v2-h2">Related help and <em>nearby towns</em></h2></div>
    <div class="v2-related">
      <div>
        <h3>Help with your move</h3>
        <ul class="v2-list">
          <li><a href="/downsizing-help-for-elderly/">Downsizing help<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          <li><a href="/moving-elderly-parent/">Moving an elderly parent<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          <li><a href="/care-home-removals/">Care home removals<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          <li><a href="/packing-service-uk/">Packing service<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          <li><a href="/storage-during-your-move/">Storage between moves<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          <li><a href="/elderly-move-manager-uk/">What a move manager does<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Other towns we help in</h3>
        <ul class="v2-list">
          <li><a href="/elderly-removals-northampton/">Northampton<small>our office</small><i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          {% set shown = 0 %}{% for other in localAreas %}{% if other.slug != area.slug and loop.index0 < 7 %}<li><a href="/elderly-removals-{{ other.slug }}/">{{ other.name }}<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>{% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <a class="v2-all" href="/areas-we-cover/">All areas we cover &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if area.relatedPosts and area.relatedPosts.length %}
<section class="v2-sec grey">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head c"><span class="v2-eyebrow">Guides</span><h2 class="v2-h2">Related <em>guides</em></h2></div>
    {#- The agent supplies only a list of { title, href }. Each card (photo, date, title) is drawn here from the post's own data, so the layout cannot drift, and an href that is not a real post draws nothing. -#}
    <div class="v2-post-cards">
      {% for rp in area.relatedPosts %}{% for post in collections.blog %}{% if post.url == rp.href %}
      <article class="news-card">
        {% if post.data.featuredImage %}<figure><a href="{{ post.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ post.data.featuredImage }}" alt="{{ post.data.featuredImageAlt | default(post.data.title) }}" width="940" height="650" loading="lazy"></a></figure>{% endif %}
        <span>{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
        <h5><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h5>
      </article>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="v2-posts-all"><a href="/guides/">Browse all guides &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="v2-final">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="txt">
        <h2 class="v2-h2">Planning a move in <em>{{ area.name }}?</em></h2>
        <p>Tell us what is happening and we&rsquo;ll explain the options plainly, with no obligation.</p>
        <div class="btn-row"><a href="/get-started/" class="v2-btn primary">Get Started</a><a href="/contact/?callback=1" class="v2-btn ghost">Request a Callback</a></div>
        <span class="tel">Or call <a href="tel:{{ site.telephone }}">{{ site.telephoneDisplay }}</a>, Monday to Friday, {{ site.openingHours.opens }} to {{ site.openingHours.closes }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="img" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl 'chayce-hero2.jpg', 900 %})"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

